	quest.5A01000000000011.title: "&3Arcanist's Regalia"
	quest.5A01000000000012.quest_desc: [
		"Your studies have reached this grimoire's final tier. Gather the demanding upgrade ingredients and prepare the Archmage Spell Book."
		""
		"Use the installed book-upgrade recipe: apprentice book, ender pearls, emeralds, Totem of Undying, Nether Star and Wilden Tribute."
	]
	quest.5A01000000000012.quest_subtitle: "Ascend to Tier 3 master glyphs of cataclysmic scale"
	quest.5A01000000000012.title: "&6&lThe Archmage Grimoire"
	quest.5A01000000000013.quest_desc: [
		"Close this part of your chronicle and look toward the next road. Your completed route records the choices you made."
		""
		"After completing this route, confirm your journal entry manually."
		"This closing entry adds no hidden boss, recipe or race requirement."
	]
	quest.5A01000000000013.quest_subtitle: "Another milestone in your journey through the Cardinal World"
	quest.5A01000000000013.title: "Archmage of the Cardinal World: Ars Mastery"
	quest.6A01000000000001.quest_desc: [
		"Some names in this world belong to more than a roadside encounter. Prepare your equipment and face the seven trials one victory at a time."
		"Maps and summons guide you to particular encounters. The battle quests require your own kill credit."
		"Begin this chapter after completing Vanguard Capstone: High Magisteel Sword."
	]
	quest.6A01000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Ascend the mountain of calamities and demon lords"
	quest.6A01000000000001.title: "Trials of the Demon Lords and Cataclysms"
	quest.6A01000000000002.quest_desc: [
		"A simple slime is not the greatest danger of its kind. Obtain this summon and prepare an open battlefield for the Supermassive Slime it calls."
		""
		"Consult the recipe or source shown in JEI as you prepare this step."
		"This summon item spawns Tensura Supermassive Slime, the exact target of the following boss quest."
	]
	quest.6A01000000000002.quest_subtitle: "Summon the gelatinous monarch of the surface plains"
	quest.6A01000000000002.title: "The Supermassive Slime"
	quest.6A01000000000003.quest_desc: [
		"The creature before you is far beyond the slimes of your first expedition. Face it as the opening great trial."
		""
		"Defeat 1 x Supermassive Slime (Tensura: Reincarnated)."
		"Target entity: tensura:supermassive_slime. You must receive kill credit."
	]
	quest.6A01000000000003.quest_subtitle: "Another milestone in your journey through the Cardinal World"
	quest.6A01000000000003.title: "Boss Trial: Supermassive Slime"
	quest.6A01000000000004.quest_desc: [
		"Rumours of hunger and conquest lead toward an ominous temple. Obtain its map and prepare to confront the Orc Disaster."
		""
	]
	quest.6A01000000000004.quest_subtitle: "Locate Geld's colossal subterranean temple"
	quest.6A01000000000004.title: "The March of Hunger: Orc Disaster"
	quest.6A01000000000005.quest_desc: [
		"Hunger has become a calamity. Confront the Orc Disaster and bring this trial to an end."
		""
		"Defeat 1 x Orc Disaster (Tensura: Reincarnated)."
		"Target entity: tensura:orc_disaster. You must receive kill credit."
	]
	quest.6A01000000000005.quest_subtitle: "Another milestone in your journey through the Cardinal World"
	quest.6A01000000000005.title: "Boss Trial: Orc Disaster"
	quest.6A01000000000006.quest_desc: [
		"The road to the Church leads toward a formidable opponent. Obtain the map and ready yourself before seeking Hinata."
		""
	]
	quest.6A01000000000006.quest_subtitle: "Infiltrate the Crusader Knights' marble cathedral"
	quest.6A01000000000006.title: "Bastion of the Holy Church"
	quest.6A01000000000007.quest_desc: [
		"Hinata is a name that deserves more than casual preparation. Ready yourself before seeking this victory."
